+++ b/.changeset/1git-diff-inclusion.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+---
+"@gpuix/native": patch
+---
+
+Add opt-in change-group and line-inclusion gutters to the virtualized diff.
+Keep selection in React, reuse cached patch data, and expose native keyboard and
+checked/mixed accessibility controls. Local 1git patch, not a release.
+Use solid accent gutters with white SVG marks/numbers and aligned hunk headers.
+Remove internal gutter rules and the separate hunk-gutter tint.
+Cache group event payloads with parsed patch data instead of per scroll row.
